docs {
  Creates or updates the general section of an application. Accepts multipart/form-data
  because optional document files (national ID, passport, visa) can be uploaded alongside.

  Success (200): data = SaveGeneralResponseDto (appRefNo, intApplication).
  Failure: 400 `validation_error`.
}
